{
  "name": "Pinterest Viral Pin Save Velocity & Outbound DTC Store Link Discovery",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Pinterest Viral Pin Save Velocity & Outbound DTC Store Link Discovery\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nTrack rapidly saved Pinterest pins and extract their outbound e-commerce product links to spot retail trends 60 days early.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/pinterest-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/pinterest-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Pinterest Scraper & Monitor Pins & Saves** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "33e78e35-588b-4e6f-a0d3-c3d9d3a0540e",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Pinterest Scraper & Monitor Pins & Saves** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "44b48720-7d98-4a4e-affb-c1cbddd9fdab",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "102d6ce4-f720-4503-a0c6-ab7f7b4d9ee7",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "81d00bc4-acaa-4661-aac9-73eb3ddf8eba",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dd94ebeb-95a8-43a7-ad1b-d4fe7434db14",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"minimalist home decor 2026\",\"summer capsule wardrobe aesthetic\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "9b11fff8-7dae-4894-a770-b7f27680abe2",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "d451e29f-3c6b-420b-afd4-e84ef27ea964",
